# ---- Card texts: base game ----

msgid "CARD_EventMilitaryDictatorshipsInTheBalkans_TEXT"
msgstr "Recruit an Italian Army in the Balkans: then eliminate an Allied Army in Ukraine."

msgid "CARD_StatusDiveBombers_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn when you battle a land space. Discard the top 1 card of your draw deck to battle in the same or adjacent land space to the one battled."

msgid "CARD_StatusWolfPacks_TEXT"
msgstr "German Economic Warfare cards containing the word \"Submarines\" discard 2 extra Allied cards (in total); 3 if a German Army occupies Scandinavia."

msgid "CARD_StatusBlitzkrieg_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn when you battle a land space. Discard the top 1 card of your draw deck to build an Army in the space battled."

msgid "CARD_StatusBiasForAction_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn when you build an Army. Discard the top 1 card of your draw deck to battle a land space adjacent to the Army just built."

msgid "CARD_StatusSuperiorPlanning_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn at the beginning of your turn. Examine the top 4 cards of your draw deck and put them back in the order of your choice."

msgid "CARD_StatusAbundantResources_TEXT"
msgstr "During your Victory step, gain +1 Victory Point for each German Army in Ukraine, Kazakhstan, or Russia."

msgid "CARD_StatusSyntheticFuel_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn when you build an Army. Discard the top 2 cards of your draw deck to build an Army adjacent to the Army just built."

msgid "CARD_EWSubmarinesRaidMurmanskConvoy_TEXT"
msgstr "For each German Army or Navy in or adjacent to Scandinavia: gain +1 Victory Point and the Soviet Union must discard the top 2 cards of its draw deck."

msgid "CARD_StatusAtlanticWall_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn when an Axis Army is battled in Western Europe. The country initiating the battle must discard the top 3 cards of its draw deck."

msgid "CARD_StatusVolksturm_TEXT"
msgstr "Use once per turn, at the beginning of your turn. Discard the top 1 card of your draw deck to recruit an Army in Germany. (This is in addition to your Play step.)"

msgid "CARD_EWSubmarinesoftheMonsoonGroup_TEXT"
msgstr "The Allied country of your choice must discard the top 2 cards of its draw deck. Gain +2 Victory Points."

msgid "CARD_EventBroadFront_TEXT"
msgstr "Conduct up to 3 battles, each in a space that was occupied by a Soviet Army adjacent to a German Army at the beginning of the turn."

msgid "CARD_EventGunsAndButter_TEXT"
msgstr "This card can be used to: build an Army; build a Navy; battle a land space; or battle a sea space."

msgid "CARD_EWSubmarinesEnforceBlockade_TEXT"
msgstr "For each German Army adjacent to the North Sea, gain +1 Victory Point and the United Kingdom must discard the top 2 cards of its draw deck."

msgid "CARD_StatusSwedishIronOre_TEXT"
msgstr "During your Victory step, gain +1 Victory Point if a German Navy is in the Baltic Sea; then gain +1 Victory Point if a German Army is in Scandinavia."

msgid "CARD_EWSubmarinesLeadtheBattleoftheAtlantic_TEXT"
msgstr "For each German Navy on the board, gain +1 Victory Point and the United Kingdom must discard the top 2 cards of its draw deck."

msgid "CARD_EWVWeapons_TEXT"
msgstr "If a German Army is in Western Europe, gain +3 Victory Points and the United Kingdom must discard the top 1 card of its draw deck."

msgid "CARD_StatusConscription_TEXT"
